# Python caches and local environments
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Generated strategy data. Keep Markdown templates and documentation.
#
# ⚠️ **必须带 `**/` 前缀**。含 `/` 的模式在 gitignore 里是**锚定仓库根**的，
# 所以 `data/**` 拦不住 `<任意目录>/data/**`。2026-08-07 实际出过事：
# 一个基线脚本把测试助手的 tmp_path 实参写成了字符串 "2026-07-16"，
# 于是在**仓库根**建出 `2026-07-16/data/trades/master_trade_ledger.csv`
# 并被 `git add -A` 提交（那次是合成 fixture，没泄露真数据 —— 但同类事故
# 若写的是真实台账就是账户数据外泄）。
data/**
**/data/**
!data/**/
!**/data/**/
!data/**/*.md
!**/data/**/*.md
# `**/data/**` 会误伤 governance/data/（文档目录，2026-08-11 重组后与运行时 data/ 同名），
# 显式放行。
!governance/data/**

# Generated review reports (may contain sensitive account data). Keep directories only.
artifacts/reports/trade_review/**
!artifacts/reports/trade_review/**/
artifacts/reports/weekly/**
!artifacts/reports/weekly/**/

# Pipeline logs and transient output
artifacts/logs/
artifacts/reports/daily/_supporting/
artifacts/reports/daily/*_daily_report.md
artifacts/reports/daily/*_1445_review.md
artifacts/reports/daily/*_final_review.json
artifacts/reports/daily/*_final_review.md
# 模板必须入库（上面 _supporting/ 等规则不覆盖它，这里显式保底）
!artifacts/reports/daily/DAILY_PLAN_TEMPLATE.md
# 同上：这些也要能拦住嵌套位置的误写
**/artifacts/reports/daily/*_final_review.json
**/artifacts/reports/daily/*_final_review.md
**/artifacts/reports/daily/*_daily_report.md
**/artifacts/reports/daily/*_1445_review.md
**/artifacts/logs/
src/_debug/
*.log
*.tmp
~$*

# Local editor and OS files
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# AI session exports (hundreds of MB, may contain account/holdings content)
/chat*.json
*.session.json
*-session-export*.json

# Coverage artifacts
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# agent 遗留的临时标记文件（17:00 agent 习惯产物，非代码无读者）
07_tools/trades/_no_trades_*.json
